{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"liuermu-e-o045","title":"刘璋遣张肃送叟兵于曹操","accounts":[{"id":"liuermu-a-710944ee2bcf0aaa59d1","label":"正文","text":"刘璋遣张肃送叟兵于曹操","evidence":["liuermu-q-33749412519052660ba3"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0253","role":"遣张肃送叟兵三百人并杂御物","evidence":["liuermu-q-33749412519052660ba3"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0049","role":"别驾从事，送叟兵与杂御物","evidence":["liuermu-q-33749412519052660ba3"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"受叟兵与御物者","evidence":["liuermu-q-33749412519052660ba3"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liuermu-q-33749412519052660ba3"]},"ordering_evidence":"liuermu-q-33749412519052660ba3","source_order":[31,69,55],"order":6462},{"id":"liuermu-e-o046","title":"曹操拜张肃广汉太守","accounts":[{"id":"liuermu-a-6c6d1fd309d87d4f1ae4","label":"正文","text":"曹操拜张肃广汉太守","evidence":["liuermu-q-8e691e1cc27dccf35cc0"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"拜张肃为广汉太守","evidence":["liuermu-q-8e691e1cc27dccf35cc0"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0049","role":"受拜广汉太守","evidence":["liuermu-q-8e691e1cc27dccf35cc0"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liuermu-q-8e691e1cc27dccf35cc0"]},"ordering_evidence":"liuermu-q-8e691e1cc27dccf35cc0","source_order":[31,69,84],"order":6463},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o040a","title":"张肃告发张松与刘璋断绝通书","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o040a-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"张松致书刘备、法正劝勿东归；张肃告发其谋，刘璋杀张松并命关戍不再与刘备通书。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o040a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xianzhu-p0045","role":"致书","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o040a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0049","role":"告发","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o040a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0253","role":"杀松断书","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o040a-q"]},{"person":"liu-bei","role":"受书","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o040a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0046","role":"受书","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o040a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"益州","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o040a-q"]},"time":{"year":212,"label":"刘备求兵资后","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xianzhu-y212","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xianzhu-q-o039","basis":"刘备求兵资后"},"evidence":["xianzhu-e-o040a-q","xianzhu-q-o039","xianzhu-q-o034","xianzhu-q-b-09400c250015597cdc75"]},"source_order":[32,166,"O040a"],"order":6560}],"persons":[{"id":"xianzhu-p0049","name":"张肃","evidence":["xianzhu-q-o040","liuermu-q-33749412519052660ba3","liuermu-q-8e691e1cc27dccf35cc0"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"xianzhu-m-o040-xianzhu-p0049","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xianzhu-q-o040"]},{"id":"xianzhu-m-p036-xianzhu-p0049","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xianzhu-q-p036"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"liuermu-q-33749412519052660ba3","section":"chapter-031","block":"b-b8148093bbe5d70f2860","layer":"original","quote":"璋复遣别驾从事蜀郡张肃，送叟兵三百人并杂御物于曹公","section_title":"刘二牧传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0068.xhtml","index":68,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":55,"end":80},{"id":"liuermu-q-8e691e1cc27dccf35cc0","section":"chapter-031","block":"b-b8148093bbe5d70f2860","layer":"original","quote":"曹公拜肃为广汉太守","section_title":"刘二牧传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0068.xhtml","index":68,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":84,"end":93},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o040a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-99986eed3c55e61e58a2","layer":"original","quote":"张松书与先主及法正曰：“今大事垂可立，如何释此去乎！”松兄广汉太守肃，惧祸逮己；白璋，发其谋。于是璋收斩松，嫌隙始构矣。﹝二﹞璋敕关戍诸将：文书勿复关通先主〖8〗。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":165,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":82},{"id":"xianzhu-q-b-09400c250015597cdc75","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-09400c250015597cdc75","layer":"modern","quote":"〖10〗十六年：建安十六年（公元 211 ）。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":152,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-8471d798647e2ff3307a","start":0,"end":23},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o034","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-464a6d3ab5db13314b70","layer":"original","quote":"十六年〖10〗，益州牧刘璋，遥闻曹公将遣钟繇等向汉中讨张鲁，内怀恐惧。别驾从事蜀郡张松说璋曰：“曹公兵强，无敌于天下；若因张鲁之资以取蜀土〖11〗，谁能御之者乎？”璋曰：“吾固忧之而未有计。”松曰：“刘豫州，使君之宗室，而曹公之深仇也，善用兵；若使之讨鲁，鲁必破；鲁破，则益州强；曹公虽来，无能为也。”","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":140,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":151},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o039","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-3fc74e22c633afc483a4","layer":"original","quote":"明年，曹公征孙权，权呼先主自救〖4〗。先主遣使告璋曰：“曹公征吴，吴忧危急；孙氏与孤，本为唇齿。又乐进在青泥与关羽相拒〖5〗；今不往救羽，进必大克；转侵州界〖6〗，其忧有甚于鲁。鲁，自守之贼，不足虑也。”乃从璋求万兵及资（宝）〔实〕〖7〗，欲以东行。璋但许兵四千，其余皆给半。﹝一﹞","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":164,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":141},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o040","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-99986eed3c55e61e58a2","layer":"original","quote":"张松书与先主及法正曰：“今大事垂可立，如何释此去乎！”松兄广汉太守肃，惧祸逮己；白璋，发其谋。于是璋收斩松，嫌隙始构矣。﹝二﹞璋敕关戍诸将：文书勿复关通先主〖8〗。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":165,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":82},{"id":"xianzhu-q-p036","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-0db6f9a5f70b8cb84627","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《益部耆旧杂记》曰：“张肃有威仪，容貌甚伟。松，为人短小，放荡不治节操；然识达精果，有才干；刘璋遣诣曹公，曹公不甚礼；公主簿杨修深器之，白公辟松，公不纳。修以公所撰兵书，示松，松宴饮之间，一（看）〔省〕便暗诵。修以此益异之。”","attribution":"《益部耆旧杂记》","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":183,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-0ecd01e327fb99e09ce9","start":0,"end":116}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
